EDENTIALS</a> structure contains the RASCM_DefaultCreds flag, the credentials returned are the default credentials for an all-user connection. To retrieve a pre-shared key, use the RASCM_PreSharedKey flag in the RASCREDENTIALS.dwMask field. <b>Windows 2000/NT:  </b>This feature is not supported. The following sample code creates the "RasEntryName" phone book entry, sets its credentials using <a href="https://docs.microsoft.com/windows/desktop/api/ras/nf-ras-rassetcredentialsa">RasSetCredentials</a>, and then retrieves those credentials using <b>RasGetCredentials</b>.</para>
