ring representation of an IPv6 address. <b>Windows Phone 8:</b> This function is supported for Windows Phone Store apps on Windows Phone 8 and later. <b>Windows 8.1</b> and <b>Windows Server 2012 R2</b>: This function is supported for Windows Store apps on Windows 8.1, Windows Server 2012 R2, and later.</para>
