> parameter. The  Description column provides some basic information about the socket option. For more complete lists of socket options and more detailed information (default values, for example), see the detailed topics under <a href="https://docs.microsoft.com/windows/desktop/WinSock/socket-options">Socket Options</a>. <i>level</i> = <b>SOL_SOCKET</b> </para>
