		/// <summary>The WSAEnumProtocols function retrieves information about available transport protocols. (Unicode)</summary>
		/// <param name="lpiProtocols">A <b>NULL</b>-terminated array of iProtocol values. This parameter is optional; if <i>lpiProtocols</i> is <b>NULL</b>, information on all available protocols is returned. Otherwise, information is retrieved only for those protocols listed in the array.</param>
