		/// <para>Type: \_In\_ **[ULONG](/windows/win32/winprog/windows-data-types)** The maximum number of [OVERLAPPED_ENTRY](/windows/win32/api/minwinbase/ns-minwinbase-overlapped_entry) structures to remove. If 0 is specified, then only registration operations will be processed.</para>
