		/// <para>On input, size of the <i>lpProtocolBuffer</i> buffer passed to **WSCEnumProtocols**, in bytes. On output, the minimum buffer size, in bytes, that can be passed to **WSCEnumProtocols** to retrieve all the requested information.</para>
