		/// <summary>The RestoreMediaSense function restores the media sensing capability of the TCP/IP stack on a local computer on which the DisableMediaSense function was previously called.</summary>
		/// <param name="pOverlapped">
		/// <para>A pointer to an <a href="https://docs.microsoft.com/windows/desktop/api/minwinbase/ns-minwinbase-overlapped">OVERLAPPED</a> structure. Except for the <b>hEvent</b> member, all members of this structure must be set to zero. The <b>hEvent</b> member should contain a handle to a valid event object. Use the <a href="https://docs.microsoft.com/windows/desktop/api/synchapi/nf-synchapi-createeventa">CreateEvent</a> function to create this event object.</para>
